{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgXFCHLecsa4oew5PRdQy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013w5QQipmU6kForXp3gkwo8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > paper/OUTLINE.md <<'EOF'\n# Outline: Invisible formatting effects\n\n1. Abstract: problem (invisible edits in production text) -> gap (no controlled ws vs punct comparison w/ noise floor) -> 11 models, 5 tasks, 10 edits, 239,616 generations -> 4.9% flips vs 0.02% control; ws 7.1% > punct 2.2%; <3B 2.2x; code text 36% but pass/fail 5.1% -> normalise whitespace.\n2. Intro: hook (CRLF, NBSP, smart quotes); importance (evals, A/B); gap (visible-template sensitivity work, Sclar/Mizrahi/ProSA); approach (Fig 1 per-condition); preview numbers; 4 contributions.\n3. Related work: prompt-format sensitivity; character-level robustness/typos; tokenization; nondeterminism of inference.\n4. Method: problem formulation (divergence wrt canonical), perturbations table, tasks, models, metrics, controls, stats.\n5. Results: overall table vs noise floor; per perturbation (Fig per_condition + table); per model (heatmap + table); size (Fig size_trend + table); task; mediators (token survival, edit size, uncertainty, accuracy).\n6. Discussion: hypotheses verdicts, mechanism, implications, limitations.\n7. Conclusion.\nEOF\ncd paper_draft && cat > main.tex <<'EOF'\n\\documentclass{article}\n\\usepackage[final]{neurips_2025}  % NEURIPS style (neurips_2025.sty is in paper_draft/)\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}  % REQUIRED: clickable links\n\\usepackage{booktabs}  % REQUIRED: professional tables\n\\usepackage{graphicx}\n\\usepackage{amsmath,amssymb}\n\n\\usepackage[utf8]{inputenc}\n\\usepackage[T1]{fontenc}\n\\usepackage{xspace}\n\\usepackage{enumitem}\n\\usepackage{subcaption}\n\\usepackage{multirow}\n\\usepackage{algorithm}\n\\usepackage[noend]{algpseudocode}\n\n% Import command files\n\\input{commands/math}\n\\input{commands/general}\n\\input{commands/macros}\n\n\\captionsetup[table]{aboveskip=4pt,belowskip=4pt}\n\\captionsetup[figure]{aboveskip=4pt,belowskip=4pt}\n\n% Use this bibliography style:\n\\bibliographystyle{plainnat}\n\n\\title{Invisible Formatting, Visible Effects: Whitespace Changes Flip\\\\ LLM Outputs More Often Than Punctuation Changes}\n\n\\author{NeuriCo}\n\n\\begin{document}\n\\maketitle\n\n\\begin{abstract}\n\\input{sections/abstract}\n\\end{abstract}\n\n\\input{sections/introduction}\n\\input{sections/related_work}\n\\input{sections/methodology}\n\\input{sections/results}\n\\input{sections/discussion}\n\\input{sections/conclusion}\n\n\\bibliography{references}\n\n\\appendix\n\\input{appendix/details}\n\n\\end{document}\nEOF\ncat > commands/macros.tex <<'EOF'\n%%%%% PROJECT-SPECIFIC MACROS %%%%%\n\\usepackage{xspace}\n\n%%%%% DATASET NAMES %%%%%\n\\newcommand{\\sst}{\\textsc{SST-2}\\xspace}\n\\newcommand{\\agnews}{\\textsc{AG News}\\xspace}\n\\newcommand{\\boolq}{\\textsc{BoolQ}\\xspace}\n\\newcommand{\\humaneval}{\\textsc{HumanEval}\\xspace}\n\\newcommand{\\mbpp}{\\textsc{MBPP}\\xspace}\n\n%%%%% MODEL FAMILIES %%%%%\n\\newcommand{\\qwentwo}{\\textsc{Qwen2.5}\\xspace}\n\\newcommand{\\qwenthree}{\\textsc{Qwen3}\\xspace}\n\\newcommand{\\llama}{\\textsc{Llama-3.x}\\xspace}\n\n%%%%% PERTURBATIONS (typewriter names) %%%%%\n\\newcommand{\\cond}[1]{\\texttt{\\detokenize{#1}}}\n\\newcommand{\\ctrl}{\\cond{control}\\xspace}\n\n%%%%% ABBREVIATIONS %%%%%\n\\newcommand{\\ie}{i.e.,\\xspace}\n\\newcommand{\\eg}{e.g.,\\xspace}\n\\newcommand{\\vs}{vs.\\xspace}\n\\newcommand{\\pp}{\\,pp\\xspace}\n\\newcommand{\\dtok}{$\\Delta$tok\\xspace}\n\\newcommand{\\ci}[2]{{\\scriptsize[#1, #2]}}\nEOF","description":"Write outline, main.tex, and project macros"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1233,"cache_read_input_tokens":68467,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_inpu